      "created_at": "2014-09-06T22:34:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The station deck is the station trash for this game as well.&nbsp; So you don't just use the 45 station deck cards.&nbsp; Once you deal the original station cards out, the deck becomes the trash and is the place you will discard to, with all those remaining cards waiting to be cycled into the game.</p>",
